<title>PHILIPPINES: Bankers Association of the Philippines announcement.</title>
<headline>Bankers Association of the Philippines announcement.</headline>
<text>
<p>To: All BAP member-bank treasurers</p>
<p>Re: Multi-vendor PDS link</p>
<p>We regret to advise that the PDS link for our multi-vendor environment is still being tested and checked. As such trading on the PDS will continue on Telerate until further notice.</p>
<p>Our apologies for the delay.</p>
<p>Thank You</p>
<p>				     Signed</p>
<p>				Asterio L. Favis</p>
<p>			  For BAP Open Market Committee</p>
</text>
